sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Bot (your server)
  participant W as Webex cloud
  participant U as Bob (Webex app)
  B->>W: POST /webhooks {resource: messages, event: created,<br/>targetUrl, filter: roomId=..., secret}
  W-->>B: 200 webhook (status "active")
  U->>W: "@NOC Alerts status" in the space
  W->>B: POST targetUrl {resource, event, data: {id, roomId, personEmail}}<br/>X-Spark-Signature: HMAC-SHA1(secret, body)
  Note over B: verify signature<br/>data has IDs only, NO text
  B->>W: GET /messages/{data.id} (Bearer bot token)
  W-->>B: 200 {"text": "NOC Alerts status", ...}
  B->>W: POST /messages {roomId, parentId, markdown}
  W-->>U: threaded reply "**3 alerts open**"
